  "generated": "---\ntitle: \"Create a new contact\"\nslug: \"/apps/ios-create-a-new-contact--oq34jldzp7zc312g712bn73x\"\nmdx: {\"format\":\"md\"}\ntags: [\"iOS\",\"General\",\"ios\",\"working-with-contacts\"]\n---\n\nTo create a new contact:\n\n1. Tap on the![App icon](/img/ringotel/original/c4c15a8e5eb3ee1b8b03/fa3a72562096b836374e36cd269b0df33a7f0e2f9e4e5848d2541289d92ba5fc.png)icon at the top right corner of the screen.\n2. Select ‘**Contact**’ from a pop-up menu:\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/4c0e43c36eb56bc70068/a29a523f960b4f242bb1d6f24375ee2fbc4cb5fd836bc23886e41b9a033243d1.png)\n\n1. Then fill in the name of the contact and add additional details.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/c449d75fd1003d633076/3783c5d06eec87b276688848dfde3e54c2c5d0e6f169199c641cc385dacfc667.png)\n\n1. Enter a contact’s name\n2. Press ‘Save’ to finish editing the contact.\n3. Add an avatar picture to the contact.\n4. Add details like phone numbers, company name, job title, etc.\n\n## Related articles\n\n- [Create a new contact](/docs/apps/android-create-new-contact--xfi4qswn3bq55vlygnatx1kk)\n- [How to add and delete a contact](/docs/apps/desktop-add-delete-contact--ahhk0yl59mshn5v92dpmdk3o)\n"
